        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "704ea13f-b1f2-5349-aaa7-7260dbe05aad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex da Kid, Eminem, Rihanna, Dr. Dre, Nicki Minaj, B.o.B, Hayley Williams, Diddy, Skylar Grey, Cheryl\n- Songs: I Need a Doctor, Massive Attack, Airplanes, Love the Way You Lie, Coming Home, Radioactive, Under The Sun\n- Albums: Recovery\n- Groups: Dirty Money, Imagine Dragons\n\nFacts:\n- Alex da Kid gained recognition for producing hit singles for artists across multiple music genres.\n- Alex da Kid produced Dr. Dre's song \"I Need a Doctor.\"\n- Alex da Kid produced Nicki Minaj's song \"Massive Attack.\"\n- Alex da Kid produced B.o.B's song \"Airplanes,\" which features Hayley Williams.\n- In 2010, Eminem released the song \"Love the Way You Lie\" on his seventh studio album \"Recovery.\"\n- \"Love the Way You Lie\" was recorded by the American rapper Eminem and features the Barbadian singer Rihanna.\n- Alex da Kid produced Eminem's song \"Love the Way You Lie,\" which features Rihanna.\n- Alex da Kid produced Diddy's song \"Coming Home\" with Dirty Money featuring Skylar Grey.\n- Alex da Kid produced Imagine Dragons' song \"Radioactive.\"\n- Alex da Kid produced Cheryl's song \"Under The Sun.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "0bbc2388-88b7-5ea5-8bfa-cd244337381d",
        "text": "Page: Alex da Kid. Sentence: He has gained recognition for producing several hit singles for a plethora of artists in various music genres, such as Dr. Dre (\"I Need a Doctor\"), Nicki Minaj (\"Massive Attack\"), B.o.B (\"Airplanes\" featuring Hayley Williams), Eminem (\"Love the Way You Lie\" featuring Rihanna), Diddy (\"Coming Home\" with Dirty Money featuring Skylar Grey), Imagine Dragons (\"Radioactive\") and Cheryl (\"Under The Sun\").\nPage: Love the Way You Lie. Sentence: \"Love the Way You Lie\" is a song recorded by the American rapper Eminem, featuring the Barbadian singer Rihanna, from Eminem's seventh studio album \"Recovery\" (2010).",
